{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_2000_situation", "source_sha256": "0ff1600845e9b52f770de802bc5db6c3aba695b7ad42235db0aceaf0e8a62e72", "ja": "モデルのお仕事　撮影後", "zh": "模特儿工作　拍摄后", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_2000_place", "source_sha256": "f1860edaa8a9578fc2484c89f70aff5f4be5b8e448a9efe39fa4812250ca02c2", "ja": "撮影スタジオ", "zh": "摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_2001_p", "source_sha256": "c673e72d3d3ad50365e6df280ace85f56178c5f4628ad058aeb99a6856048a9e", "ja": "貴音、撮影お疲れ様。スタッフさん達、驚いてたぞ。\n本職のモデルよりもスタイルがいいって。", "zh": "贵音，拍摄辛苦了。工作人员都很惊讶喔。\n大家都称赞你的身材比专业模特儿还好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_2002_008tak", "source_sha256": "21e6a53f81650ca5267595a96165d35581d4e9977432236adbbc28dc07affae1", "ja": "まぁ……ふふっ。そのような賛辞をいただけるとは、\nなんとも光栄なことです。", "zh": "哎呀……呵呵。能得到这样的赞美，\n真是令人感到光荣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_2003_p", "source_sha256": "2380e399f908f3ef001e0d153438cf50286ffaf94cf978fd247b7b0bf03acb4f", "ja": "でも、考えてみると不思議だな。貴音は……その、\nたくさん食べる方なのに、どうして太らないんだ？", "zh": "不过，这么一想就觉得很不可思议。贵音你……那个，\n明明很能吃，但为什么不会胖？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_2004_008tak", "source_sha256": "59a911cea50bb82c6c97d16c63589a4bf2b648fa3bdabe37d6f962f73f4602d0", "ja": "はっ……。もしや{$P$}は、\n私が食べ過ぎだとお思いなのですか？", "zh": "啊……莫非{$P$}\n认为小女子吃太多了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_2005_p", "source_sha256": "6b20ec74b22c31d49da8ccc3471154392200794c625b911c8720d28499084651", "ja": "えっ。いやまあ、食べ過ぎかどうかは\n本人次第だと思うけど……。", "zh": "欸，不是，怎么说呢，\n我觉得会不会吃太多要看个人吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_2006_008tak", "source_sha256": "6037dfdf1f4b1e17a37df73611cc2e4a71c7acca846befb82db44885333f15d3", "ja": "そうですか……。では、どうかご安心ください。\n私も未熟者ではありますが、心得てはいるつもりです。", "zh": "是这样啊……那么，请你放心。\n小女子虽然也还不成熟，但自有分寸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_2007_008tak", "source_sha256": "ec597066fcd769dc2f8f7a4a1e943500ba0fbac5524805bbff5b4da0432ac2f1", "ja": "己を律するのは、アイドルとして当然のつとめ。\nですから、食事は常に腹八分目、と……。", "zh": "律己是偶像理所当然的职责。\n因此，小女子用餐总是维持八分饱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_008tak_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_008tak_2008_p", "source_sha256": "1f0dd2521694a6dace0a1f9545cec61b4848399360f643f2f08daa1774df84bb", "ja": "そ、そうか。八分目だったのか……。", "zh": "这、这样啊，原来那样是八分饱啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
